#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform."
msgstr ""
"Paano gamitin ang isang virtual private endpoint para kumonekta nang pribado"
" sa IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang mga virtual private endpoint para sa VPC para kumonekta nang "
"pribado sa IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-"
"ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang mga virtual private endpoint para sa VPC para kumonekta nang "
"pribado sa IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-"
"privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for VPC to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; "
"from your VPC network by using IP address that you specify, allocated from a"
" subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) para sa VPC para kumonekta sa "
"IBM Quantum&reg; mula sa iyong VPC network gamit ang IP address na iyong "
"tinutukoy, na inilaan mula sa isang subnet sa loob ng iyong VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created"
" on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that"
" scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all "
"availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from"
" virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the "
"private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within"
" your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga VPE ay mga virtual IP interface na nakatali sa isang endpoint "
"gateway na nilikha batay sa bawat serbisyo. Ang endpoint gateway ay isang "
"virtualized na function na nagpapalaki nang pahalang, ay redundant at lubos "
"na available, at sumasaklaw sa lahat ng availability zone ng iyong VPC. Ang "
"mga endpoint gateway ay nagbibigay-daan sa komunikasyon mula sa mga virtual "
"server instance sa loob ng iyong VPC at IBM Cloud&reg; service sa pribadong "
"backbone. Ang VPE para sa VPC ay nagbibigay sa iyo ng kontrol sa lahat ng "
"pribadong address sa loob ng iyong cloud. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, "
"tingnan ang [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within IBM Quantum Platform, all customer data is transmitted over the "
"private network regardless of whether it is accessed through a public "
"endpoint or VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa loob ng IBM Quantum Platform, lahat ng data ng customer ay ipinapadala sa"
" pamamagitan ng pribadong network, anuman ang paraan ng pag-access — public "
"endpoint man o VPE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connecting to IBM Quantum Platform through the public endpoints transmits "
"all request and response data over the public internet. To connect to IBM "
"Quantum Platform by using a VPE, you must use the IBM Quantum Platform API "
"or SDK. IBM Quantum Platform can only be accessed through the public "
"network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pagkonekta sa IBM Quantum Platform sa pamamagitan ng mga public endpoint"
" ay nagpapadala ng lahat ng request at response na data sa pamamagitan ng "
"pampublikong internet. Para kumonekta sa IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang VPE,"
" kailangan mong gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform API o SDK. Ang IBM Quantum "
"Platform ay maaari lamang ma-access sa pamamagitan ng pampublikong "
"network.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago ka mag-target ng VPE para sa IBM Quantum Platform, kumpletuhin ang mga "
"sumusunod na hakbang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gumawa ng Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Mag-plano para sa network "
"topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-planning-considerations) "
"para kumonekta sa mga VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Magtakda ng mga access control](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) para sa iyong VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) of having a VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Unawain ang mga [limitasyon](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) ng pagkakaroon ng VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand how to [view VPE "
"details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr ""
"Unawain kung paano [tingnan ang mga detalye ng "
"VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Mag-set up ng VPE para sa IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-"
"quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you"
" must specify the [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region "
"in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following "
"table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr ""
"May ilang paraan para gumawa ng VPE gateway. Kung gagamitin mo ang "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) o "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), "
"kailangan mong tukuyin ang [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) ng rehiyon kung"
" saan mo gustong kumonekta sa IBM Quantum Platform. Suriin ang sumusunod na "
"talahanayan para sa mga available na rehiyon at CRN.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Rehiyon | Mga Plano   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr "Pag-configure ng endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para i-configure ang isang VPE gateway, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services "
"available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ilista ang mga available na serbisyo, kasama ang mga IBM Cloud "
"infrastructure service na available (bilang default) para sa lahat ng VPC "
"user.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be "
"privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gumawa ng endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) para sa IBM Quantum Platform na gusto mong maging"
" pribadong available sa VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr ""
"[I-bind ang isang reserved na IP "
"address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip) "
"sa endpoint gateway.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Tingnan ang mga nalikha na VPE "
"gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway) na nauugnay sa IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum "
"Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon ang iyong mga virtual server instance sa VPC ay maaaring ma-access "
"ang iyong IBM Quantum Platform instance nang pribado.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang iyong VPE para sa IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-"
"quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos gumawa ng endpoint gateway para sa IBM Quantum Platform, sundin "
"ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang VPE kasama ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-"
"with-qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang suporta sa VPE ay nangangailangan ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 o mas bago.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nag-instantiate ng `QiskitRuntimeService`, tukuyin ang "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang VPE kasama ang IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-"
"quantum-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service"
" endpoint's FQDN for the target region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos gumawa ng endpoint gateway para sa IBM Quantum Platform, gamitin "
"ang FQDN ng service endpoint para sa target na rehiyon.\n"
